ute count(*) on colocated and non-colocated table at source -> Works fine\r\n4. Execute count(*) on non-colocated table at Target universe -> Fails for some non-colocated tables\r\n```\r\n**Instance Used**: c5.2xlarge(8 core and 16GB) with RF3\r\n\r\n\r\n[Source-172.151.19.68-logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/11279729/172.151.19.68-logs.tar.gz)\r\n[Source-172.151.18.86-logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/11279730/172.151.18.86-logs.tar.gz)\r\n[Source-172.151.29.92-logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/11279731/172.151.29.92-logs.tar.gz)\r\n\r\n[Target-172.151.26.179-logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/11279737/172.151.26.179-logs.tar.gz)\r\n[Target-172.151.26.146-logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/11279738/172.151.26.146-logs.tar.gz)\r\n[Target-172.151.19.7-logs.tar.gz](https://github.com/yugabyte/yugabyte-db/files/11279740/172.151.19.7-logs.tar.gz)\r\n\r\n\n\n### Warning: Please confirm that this issue does not contain any sensitive information\n\n- [X] I confirm this issue does not contain any sensitive information.\n\n[DB-6280]: https://yugabyte.atlassian.net/browse/DB-6280?atlOrigin=eyJpIjoiNWRkNTljNzYxNjVmNDY3MDlhMDU5Y2ZhYzA5YTRkZjUiLCJwIjoiZ2l0aHViLWNvbS1KU1cifQ","closed_by":{"login":"rthallamko3","id":17170123,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MTcwMTIz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17170123?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3","html_url":"https://github.com/rthallamko3","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthallamko3/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rthalla